Block Runner for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of Block Runner 26.3.0 by Fuzs.
Original source: https://github.com/Fuzss/blockrunner
Original licence: MPL-2.0

Ported to Horizon by lavoide (version 0.4.0), and to Sunrise by arismoko (version 0.5.0): the
behaviour is re-implemented in Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included). This port is
distributed under the same licence as the original (MPL-2.0); the licence text is in LICENSE.

The original's assets licence (LICENSE-ASSETS.md, All Rights Reserved) doesn't apply: this package
carries no assets from it. Its data files (src/data/) hold the original's block tags and speeds.
